  "body": "Follow-up of the delta review of PR #3997 (merged for v0.27.0). It is not a defect of the product.\n\n## What happens\n\n`crates/app/tests/start_exit_shared.rs`, near line 94: the capability test has a `_` arm with a panic text. The text lists the kinds that have a start pick and an exit pick. After the merges of #3970 (hole order) and #3980 (sinker picks), the text does not name the hole-order kinds (Drill, Bore, Thread) and the sinker kinds (Sinker Burn, Sinker Side Burn).\n\n## What is expected\n\nThe panic text names each pick kind that the match above it handles. A person who reads the failure then sees the full list.\n\n## Fix\n\nChange the text of the panic message. Change no assertion.\n",
